<title>NEW ZEALAND: Eastern Equities yr profit falls 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Eastern Equities yr profit falls 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Aug 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    3.10 vs 3.65</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.2 vs 10.9</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    4.0 vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)	   6.5 vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Turnover			     80.75 vs 65.43</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 3.90 vs 5.14</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.20 vs 1.49</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		     0.46 vs nil</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   33.61 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries 1.970 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 20</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 29</p>
<p>    Ex div   Dec 2</p>
<p>Note - Eastern Equities is a deer farming, horticulture and transport company.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
